nt-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">C</text>\n<circle cx=\"185.00\" cy=\"165.00\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<text x=\"169.00\" y=\"157.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">O</text>\n<text x=\"325\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">NOT TO</text>\n<text x=\"325\" y=\"80\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">SCALE</text>\n</svg>",
   "stem": "<p><i>A</i>, <i>B</i> and <i>C</i> are points on the circle, centre <i>O</i>.<br>Angle <i>AOC</i> = 126\u00b0.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Find angle <i>ABC</i>.",
     "ans": "Angle <i>ABC</i> =",
     "m": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "Find angle <i>OAC</i>.",
     "ans": "Angle <i>OAC</i> =",
     "m": 1
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "63",
     "1",
     "B1<br>angle at centre = 2 \u00d7 angle at circumference"
    ],
    [
     "27",
     "1",
     "B1<br>triangle <i>OAC</i> isosceles, (180 \u2212 126) \u00f7 2"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Angle <i>AOC</i> = 126\u00b0 is the angle at the centre standing on arc <i>AC</i>.",
      "given"
     ],
     [
      "Angle <i>ABC</i> = 126 \u00f7 2 = <b>63\u00b0</b>",
      "the angle at the centre is twice the angle at the circumference standing on the same arc"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "<i>OA</i> = <i>OC</i>, so triangle <i>OAC</i> is isosceles.",
      "both are radii"
     ],
     [
      "Angle <i>OAC</i> = (180 \u2212 126) \u00f7 2 = <b>27\u00b0</b>",
      "angle sum of a triangle; base angles of an isosceles triangle are equal"
     ]
    ]
   ]
