     "ans": "Angle <i>SPQ</i> =",
     "m": 1
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "76",
     "1",
     "B1<br>opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral, 180 \u2212 104"
    ],
    [
     "101",
     "1",
     "B1<br>180 \u2212 79"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "<i>PQRS</i> is a cyclic quadrilateral, so angles <i>PQR</i> and <i>PSR</i> are opposite.",
      "all four vertices lie on the circle"
     ],
     [
      "Angle <i>PSR</i> = 180 \u2212 104 = <b>76\u00b0</b>",
      "opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral add up to 180\u00b0"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "Angles <i>QRS</i> and <i>SPQ</i> are the other pair of opposite angles.",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Angle <i>SPQ</i> = 180 \u2212 79 = <b>101\u00b0</b>",
      "opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral add up to 180\u00b0"
     ]
    ]
   ]
