   "stem": "<p><i>A</i>, <i>B</i> and <i>C</i> are points on the circle, centre <i>O</i>.<br><i>TAS</i> is a tangent to the circle at <i>A</i> and angle <i>SAB</i> = 58\u00b0.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
